                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJIzAxSgCvQjQRP4kH_C8T2Ac/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNfdEpTQ2JnEAE",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "a year ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "What a great experience!  Dropped in late afternoon on a Monday.  We sat in the upper floor after first taking our shoes off.   Experienced a very warm and gracious welcome by the owner.    Enjoyed lattes, tea and a fresh baked scone.   My wife and I had a great chat with two young women next to us and the owner noticed so surprised us all with “friendship coffee” to help us continue our conversation.   Fantastic experience all around!   Wish more every day experiences were as unique and human-touch as this coffee house.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
